Package: doctor7-web
Version: @VERSION@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: apache2 (>= 2.4)
Recommends: doctor7-api
Maintainer: doctor7-onprem maintainers <maintainers@example.org>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://example.org/doctor7-onprem
Description: doctor7-onprem web front end and Apache virtual host
 Static files of the doctor7-onprem web application and an Apache virtual
 host with TLS, security headers, a content security policy, and proxy rules
 for /api and /ws.
 .
 The package enables the Apache modules it needs. It does not enable the site.
 Set the values in /etc/doctor7/web.vars.conf, then run a2ensite doctor7. The
 TLS certificate is not part of the package.
